{"id": "EUVD-2026-60601", "enisaUuid": "1ee38ef9-60a4-3135-b50e-028759d9de0a", "description": "Grav before 2.0.14 fails to guard the access field in the core group blueprint with the required security@: admin.super restriction. A delegated admin.users operator can save a group with access[admin][super]=true to escalate to super-admin, gaining scheduler and Twig evaluation capabilities.", "datePublished": "2026-08-18T11:19:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:59", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-xhfv-7758-r9hx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-before-privilege-escalation-via-group-access-field"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-75837", "GHSA-m97h-2qj3-5773", "GHSA-xhfv-7758-r9hx"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9d97a856-0b38-35c4-85b8-de9212596f65", "product": {"name": "grav", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.0.14"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9baaddc1-889f-3cdd-b92c-26df19bfc59c", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}